      "id": "claim_51d0d84294da490199c9fe302fef5974",
      "statement": "The LangGraph StateGraph fans out from START to six fetcher nodes via the Send API (fetch_jobs/RemoteOK, fetch_sjobs/Himalayas, fetch_tjobs/Remotive, fetch_fjobs/Jobicy, fetch_wjobs/Workable, fetch_gjobs/Getro), each with a plain edge to collect_results which edges to END.",
