      "statement": "canon() and ALIASES spell synonyms one way before matching (machine learning→ml, artificial intelligence→ai, full stack→fullstack, developer→engineer, etc.), unifying query and title tokens so disjoint spellings become one result set; canon is applied by signal_tokens, job_title, and inside score_job (to the description and query words), but distinctive_tokens tokenizes the raw query without alias normalization.",
